-- =====================================================================
-- P6: SHOWCASE DATA
-- =====================================================================
-- Eight projects chosen to exercise every behaviour the app now has:
--   * a 12-month baseline vs a 36-month final (term normalisation)
--   * a straightforward hard reduction
--   * a NET INCREASE - negative reduction, shown in parentheses
--   * NO BASELINE - whole span books as avoidance, reduction is n/a
--   * NO OPENING - total collapses to reduction
--   * an IN-FLIGHT deal - reports as forecast, not booked
--   * a 5-year term with the escalator priced into the offer
--   * a SUPPORT project with no savings at all
--
-- Every savings figure below was COMPUTED by the same chain the app uses,
-- on the whole-term basis, so the seeded rows agree with what the
-- Calculations tab derives. Generated by scratchpad/gen_showcase.py.
-- =====================================================================

